    "detailed_description": "Bad Business is an extremely challenging top-down tactical shooter game where Mr. Bunny Rabbit, a hitman for the Mob, has been tasked to neutralize the rival Gang. A hard task for any organization, an impossible task for a hitman.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete 20 extremely challenging levels<br></li><li>Be the best hitman in the world by completing every level as quickly as possible and becoming number 1 on the leaderboards<br></li><li>Complete all challenges on every level to earn gold coins to unlock new weapons<br></li><li>Design and create your own levels using the Bad Business level editor and share your creations with others online via Steam Workshop</li></ul>",
